  "comment": "One part of the Chauvet DJ GigBAR MOVE + ILS, patched as its own fixture at the bar's start address plus the part's offset (docs/GIGBAR_RIG.md). The bar itself must be in its 52CH (Version 2) or 50CH DMX mode.",
